Google Chrome:
1. In the address bar, open: chrome://extensions
2. Turn on "Developer mode" in the top right corner
3. Click "Load unpacked"
4. Select the folder for the specific version: "belyaev-dnt"


Yandex Browser:
1. In the address bar, open: browser://extensions
2. Turn on "Developer mode" in the top right corner
3. Click "Load unpacked"
4. Select the folder for the specific version: "belyaev-dnt"
